					<div id="elementor-tab-content-7214" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-7214"><p>To <a href="/track-order/"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">track your order</span></a>, please add your order number and the email address used when placing your order.</p><p>Once your order has been shipped from our warehouse, we will send a delivery confirmation by email with tracking number / package ID. By clicking the tracking link in the delivery confirmation, you will be directed to the tracking page where you will be able to track your parcel.</p></div>
